    "# External Validation Script - TCGA to PAIP\\n",
    "This script performs external validation using models trained on TCGA and evaluates them on PAIP dataset.\\n",
    "\\n",
    "**Models supported:** Logistic Regression, KNN, Protonet, ANN, Random Forest\\n",
    "\\n",
    "**Configuration:** Modify the variables in the configuration section below to change:\\n",
    "- Aggregation method\\n",
    "- Model name\\n", 
    "- Task\\n",
    "\\n",
    "Everything else updates automatically based on these settings."
   ]
